    {"id": "n06", "type": "say", "mode": "character", "character": "user:showcase.lin_deng", "portrait": "normal", "voice": "user:showcase.lin_greeting", "text": "灯已点亮。前路虽远，也总有一处能照见脚下。"},
    {"id": "n07", "type": "say", "mode": "character", "character": "player", "portrait": "normal", "text": "你是送信来的，还是专程来讲道理的？"},
    {"id": "n08", "type": "say", "mode": "character", "character": "user:showcase.lin_deng", "portrait": "happy", "text": "两样都是。先听哪一样，由你选。"},
    {"id": "n09", "type": "sound", "name": "user:showcase.lantern_chime", "kind": "sound", "op": "play"},
    {"id": "n10", "type": "flag", "flag": "FEATURE_SHOWCASE_MET_COURIER"},
    {"id": "n11", "type": "game_flag", "flag": "FEATURE_SHOWCASE_ROUTE_SCORE", "value": 1, "op": "set"},
